ADDITIONAL NOTICE — PEDAGOGICAL TOOL ONLY

MindMirror is a pedagogical / awareness self-assessment tool. It is NOT a
psychological test, NOT a diagnostic instrument, and NOT clinically validated.
The bias detection and bubble scoring are simplified heuristics inspired by
academic research, not scientific consensus. The author makes no claim
regarding clinical, educational, or research validity. Any use beyond personal
self-reflection is at the user's sole responsibility.
